# Frontend Design System

> **Philosophy:** Every pixel has purpose. Restraint is luxury. User psychology drives decisions.
> **Core Principle:** THINK, don't memorize. ASK, don't assume.

---

## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule (MANDATORY)

