### Test Plan
| Test Case | Type | Coverage |
|-----------|------|----------|
| Should create user | Unit | Happy path |
| Should reject invalid email | Unit | Validation |
| Should handle db error | Unit | Error case |

### Generated Tests

`tests/[file].test.ts`

